#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: customs.php
msgid "Customs - EU Import Duty for WooCommerce"
msgstr ""

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: customs.php
msgid "https://plogins.com/plogins-customs/"
msgstr "https://plogins.com/es/plogins-customs/"

#. Description of the plugin
#: customs.php
msgid ""
"Estimate and add the EU flat import duty (from 1 July 2026) as a clear "
"checkout line for parcels shipped into the EU from outside it."
msgstr ""
"Estima y añade el arancel fijo de importación de la UE (desde el 1 de julio "
"de 2026) como una línea clara en el pago para paquetes enviados a la UE "
"desde fuera de ella."

#. Author of the plugin
#: customs.php
msgid "WPPoland.com"
msgstr "WPPoland.com"

#. Author URI of the plugin
#: customs.php
msgid "https://wppoland.com"
msgstr "https://wppoland.com"

#: customs.php:48
msgid ""
"Customs - EU Import Duty for WooCommerce requires WooCommerce to be active."
msgstr ""
"Customs - arancel de importación de la UE para WooCommerce requiere que "
"WooCommerce esté activo."

#: src/Admin/ProductFields.php:35
msgid "Customs tariff code"
msgstr "Código arancelario"

#: src/Admin/ProductFields.php:37
msgid ""
"Optional. Products sharing a code count as one EU import duty line. Leave "
"empty to group by category."
msgstr ""
"Opcional. Los productos que comparten un código cuentan como una línea de "
"arancel de importación de la UE. Déjalo vacío para agrupar por categoría."

#: src/Admin/ProductFields.php:38
msgid "e.g. 6109 (T-shirts)"
msgstr "p. ej. 6109 (camisetas)"

#: src/Admin/ProductFields.php:45
msgid "Country of origin"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/ProductFields.php:47
msgid ""
"Where the goods were made. Products with the same tariff line but a "
"different origin count as separate duty lines. Leave on the store default to "
"use the one set under WooCommerce, EU Import Duty."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/ProductFields.php:48
msgid "Store default"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/ProductFields.php:53
msgid "Outside the 3 EUR duty"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/ProductFields.php:54
msgid ""
"Tick for goods that claim a preferential tariff, for example under a trade "
"agreement, and are not imported under IOSS. They add no duty line. Their "
"value still counts toward the goods-value threshold."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:52 src/Admin/Settings.php:53
#: src/Admin/Settings.php:114
msgid "EU Import Duty"
msgstr "Arancel de importación de la UE"

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:93
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Ajustes"

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:102
msgid "You do not have permission to manage these settings."
msgstr "No tienes permiso para gestionar estos ajustes."

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:117
msgid ""
"From 1 July 2026 until 1 July 2028 the EU charges a temporary customs duty "
"of 3 EUR per item on goods sold in distance sales and shipped into the EU "
"from outside it, in consignments up to the goods-value threshold, with or "
"without IOSS. Goods imported without IOSS that claim a preferential tariff "
"are not covered; tick \"Outside the 3 EUR duty\" on those products. An item "
"is goods sharing the same tariff classification, description and origin; the "
"plugin counts one item per distinct tariff line and country of origin. How "
"the estimate reaches the shopper is set under \"Who pays the duty\"."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:121
msgid "Settings saved."
msgstr "Ajustes guardados."

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:130
msgid "Enable duty estimate"
msgstr "Activar la estimación del arancel"

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:134
msgid "Add the EU import duty line to qualifying carts."
msgstr ""
"Añade la línea de arancel de importación de la UE a los carritos que cumplen "
"los requisitos."

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:139
msgid "Legal period"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:143
msgid "Only apply the duty between 1 July 2026 and 1 July 2028"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:145
msgid ""
"Council Regulation (EU) 2026/382, Article 2 sets this period, so outside it "
"no duty line is added. Untick only if the period is extended."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:149
msgid "Who pays the duty"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:154
msgid ""
"Charge it at checkout (DDP): the duty is added to the order total as its own "
"pre-tax line."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:155
msgid ""
"Show it as an estimate only (DAP): the shopper sees the amount but it is not "
"added to the total, because it is paid on delivery."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:156
msgid ""
"Absorb it: the shopper sees and pays nothing extra, and the amount is "
"recorded on the order for your records."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:167
msgid ""
"In the Cart and Checkout Blocks an estimate is shown on the order "
"confirmation and in the order emails, not in the cart."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:172
msgid "Duty per tariff line (EUR)"
msgstr "Arancel por línea arancelaria (EUR)"

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:175
msgid ""
"EU rule: 3 EUR per item (temporary, until 1 July 2028). The plugin treats "
"each distinct tariff line as one item."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:179
msgid "Goods-value threshold (EUR)"
msgstr "Umbral de valor de mercancías (EUR)"

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:182
msgid ""
"The duty applies only when the cart goods value is at or below this amount. "
"EU rule: 150 EUR."
msgstr ""
"El arancel se aplica solo cuando el valor de las mercancías del carrito es "
"igual o inferior a este importe. Regla de la UE: 150 EUR."

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:186
msgid "Store currency per 1 EUR"
msgstr "Moneda de la tienda por 1 EUR"

#. translators: %s: store currency code.
#: src/Admin/Settings.php:192
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Used to convert the EUR amounts into your store currency (%s). Leave at 1 if "
"you sell in EUR."
msgstr ""
"Se usa para convertir los importes en EUR a la moneda de tu tienda (%s). "
"Déjalo en 1 si vendes en EUR."

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:198
msgid "Store origin country"
msgstr "País de origen de la tienda"

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:201
msgid "Use WooCommerce base country"
msgstr "Usar el país base de WooCommerce"

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:214
msgid ""
"Where parcels ship from. The duty only applies when this is outside the EU "
"customs territory. Ceuta and Melilla are outside it: a Spanish store address "
"in the province of Ceuta or Melilla, or with a postcode starting 51 or 52, "
"counts as outside the EU."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:218
msgid "Default country of origin"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:221
msgid "Not set"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:234
msgid ""
"Where your goods are made, for products without their own \"Country of "
"origin\" on the Shipping tab. Under Delegated Regulation (EU) 2015/2446, "
"Article 1(61), goods with the same tariff classification but a different "
"declared origin are separate items, so the plugin counts each tariff line "
"once per country of origin."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:238
msgid "Tariff line basis"
msgstr "Base de las líneas arancelarias"

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:243
msgid "One line per distinct product category (recommended)"
msgstr "Una línea por categoría de producto distinta (recomendado)"

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:247
msgid "One line per distinct product"
msgstr "Una línea por producto distinto"

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:249
msgid ""
"A tariff code set on a product always overrides this; products sharing a "
"code count as one line."
msgstr ""
"Un código arancelario definido en un producto siempre anula esto; los "
"productos que comparten un código cuentan como una línea."

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:253
msgid "Count a subcategory under the category it sits in"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:257
msgid ""
"Off: Other Products > Beads and Other Products > Pictures count as two "
"lines. On: Books > Health and Books > Self improvement count as one. Which "
"one is right depends on what your categories mean, so it is a choice rather "
"than a rule. Give the products a tariff code and neither setting applies to "
"them."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:264
msgid "Checkout line label"
msgstr "Etiqueta de la línea en el pago"

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:267
msgid ""
"Leave empty to use the translated default shown in the field, so the line "
"reads in the language of each shop."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:271
msgid "Apply tax to the duty"
msgstr "Aplicar impuesto al arancel"

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:275
msgid ""
"Charge tax on the duty fee. Off by default, as customs duty is not normally "
"taxed."
msgstr ""
"Cobrar impuesto sobre la cuota del arancel. Desactivado por defecto, porque "
"el arancel aduanero normalmente no se grava."

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:280
msgid "Save settings"
msgstr "Guardar ajustes"

#. translators: 1: products carrying a tariff code, 2: published products
#: src/Admin/Settings.php:385
#, php-format
msgid "Tariff codes found on %1$d of %2$d published products."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:395
msgid ""
"The rest fall back to the category rule above. The field is called \"Customs "
"tariff code\" and sits on the product's Shipping tab, which WooCommerce "
"hides for products marked Virtual, and a code held in another plugin's field "
"is not read here."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:410
msgid ""
"No store origin country is set in WooCommerce, so the duty cannot be "
"applied. Set a base country or choose an origin below."
msgstr ""
"No se ha definido ningún país de origen de la tienda en WooCommerce, por lo "
"que no se puede aplicar el arancel. Define un país base o elige un origen "
"abajo."

#. translators: %s: ISO country code.
#: src/Admin/Settings.php:418
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Origin %s is inside the EU, so the duty will not be added (intra-EU "
"shipments are excluded)."
msgstr ""
"El origen %s está dentro de la UE, por lo que no se añadirá el arancel (los "
"envíos dentro de la UE están excluidos)."

#: src/Cart/DutyFeeApplicator.php:81 src/Cart/DutyFeeApplicator.php:135
msgid "Not included in the total. Paid on delivery."
msgstr ""

#: src/Cart/DutyFeeApplicator.php:164
msgid "Absorbed by the store, not charged to the customer."
msgstr ""

#: src/Cart/DutyFeeApplicator.php:165
msgid "Shown to the customer as paid on delivery, not charged."
msgstr ""

